{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"MAT","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"马太福音","commonName":"马太福音","title":"马太福音","order":40,"numberOfChapters":28,"sha256":"cb976bdaab3d48920627d0a7d7e253e7af9397a2f353687afb31854f81be656c","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/MAT/1.json","lastChapterNumber":28,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/MAT/28.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1071},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶稣受试探"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["后来，耶稣随圣灵的引导来到旷野，受魔鬼的试探。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["耶稣禁食了四十昼夜后，很饥饿。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["试探者前来对祂说：“你如果是上帝的儿子，就叫这些石头变成食物吧。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["耶稣回答说：“圣经上说，‘人活着不是单靠食物，而是靠上帝口中的每一句话。’",{"noteId":9},"”"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["魔鬼又带祂进圣城，让祂站在圣殿的最高处，"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["说：“你如果是上帝的儿子，就跳下去吧！因为圣经上说，‘上帝会吩咐祂的天使用手托住你，不让你的脚碰在石头上。’",{"noteId":10},"”"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["耶稣回答说：“圣经上也说，‘不可试探主你的上帝。’",{"noteId":11},"”"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["魔鬼再带耶稣到一座极高的山上，把世上万国及其荣华展示给祂看，"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["说：“如果你俯伏敬拜我，我就把这一切都给你。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["耶稣说：“撒旦，走开！圣经上说，‘要敬拜主你的上帝，单单事奉祂。’",{"noteId":12},"”"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["于是魔鬼离开了耶稣，这时有天使前来伺候祂。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["开始传道"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["耶稣听见约翰被捕入狱，就回到加利利。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["后来，祂离开拿撒勒去迦百农居住。迦百农靠近湖边，在西布伦和拿弗他利地区。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["这就应验了以赛亚先知的话："]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"text":"“西布伦、拿弗他利、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沿海一带及约旦河东、外族人居住的加利利啊！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那住在黑暗中的人看见了大光，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"活在死荫之地的人被光照亮了！”","poem":1},{"noteId":13}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["从那时起，耶稣开始传道：“悔改吧，因为天国临近了！”"]},{"type":"heading","content":["呼召门徒"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["耶稣沿着加利利湖边走，看见被称为彼得的西门和他弟弟安得烈正向湖里撒网。他们是渔夫。"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["耶稣对他们说：“来跟从我！我要使你们成为得人的渔夫。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["他们立刻撇下渔网，跟从了耶稣。"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["耶稣再往前走，又看见雅各和约翰两兄弟正与父亲西庇太在船上补网。耶稣呼召他们，"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["他们马上离开渔船，辞别父亲，跟从了耶稣。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["教导和医治"]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["耶稣走遍加利利，在各个会堂里教导人，传讲天国的福音，医治人们各样的疾病。"]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["祂的名声传遍了整个叙利亚。人们把一切患病的，就是被各种疾病和疼痛折磨的、癫痫的、瘫痪的，以及被鬼附身的都带到祂面前，祂就医治了他们。"]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":["因此，有大群的人跟从了祂，他们来自加利利、低加坡里、耶路撒冷、犹太和约旦河东。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":9,"caller":"+","text":"申命记8:3。","reference":{"chapter":4,"verse":4}},{"noteId":10,"caller":"+","text":"诗篇91:11、12。","reference":{"chapter":4,"verse":6}},{"noteId":11,"caller":"+","text":"申命记6:16。","reference":{"chapter":4,"verse":7}},{"noteId":12,"caller":"+","text":"申命记6:13。","reference":{"chapter":4,"verse":10}},{"noteId":13,"caller":"+","text":"以赛亚书9:1、2。","reference":{"chapter":4,"verse":16}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/MAT/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/MAT/5.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/MAT/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":25}